=== 3) 宿主抛法的可观察出口 ===
  ✅ D1 create 抛错 → 计入 failed  = 1
  ✅ D1 create 抛错 → 不中断整轮  = 0
     D1 reason="host-create-rejected"
  ✅ D2 create 返回垃圾 → 计入 failed  = 1
     D2 reason="host-create-invalid-result"
  ✅ D2b create 返回 null → 计入 failed  = 1
  ✅ D3 catalog 抛错 → degraded=true  = true
  ✅ D3 catalog 抛错 → 不删任何东西  = 0
  ✅ D3 catalog 抛错 → 不建任何东西  = 0
     D4 delete 抛错 → failed=0 removed=0
  ✅ D4 delete 抛错有可观察出口  failed=0
  ✅ D5 history 抛错 → UNKNOWN  = 1
  ✅ D5 history 抛错 → 宿主提醒保留  = 1
  ✅ D5 history 抛错 → 不重建  = 0
  ✅ D6 catalog 返回非数组 → degraded  = true
  ✅ D6 catalog 返回非数组 → 不删  = 0
     D7 delete 返回 {deleted:false} → failed=0
  ✅ D7 delete 失败有可观察出口  failed=0
     D8 delete 返回 not_found → removed=0 failed=0
  ✅ D8 not_found 有可观察出口  removed=0 failed=0

=== 4) 静默吞检查：catalog 失败时是否仍删 ===
  ✅ 先建 1 条  = 1
  ✅ catalog 挂掉 → 不删  = 0
  ✅ catalog 挂掉 → degraded  = true
  ✅ catalog 挂掉 → 宿主那条还在  = 1

